            "review_title": "Review at Baguette & Chocolat",
            "review_text": "Selina\n5 contributions\n1\nGood place to eat after a museum visit\nJan 2019 • Friends\nAs other reviewers have already pointed out, the staff may be struggling a little bit to get everything correct without any problems. But to complain about that even though it is a place that tries to help disadvantaged youth seems just ridiculous. Our servers were very attentive, the food was good and not expensive at all and we had a wonderful time. I would go eat there again any time.\nThe only thing I would change is the fact that a lot of people that eat at the restaurant do not know that it is a training place for the staff. Most people would probably appriciate the service more if they knew that.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 3, 2019",
