            "review_text": "AnnMo83\nLondon, United Kingdom94 contributions\n1\nA bit disappointing\nNov 2018 • Friends\nWe went there after visiting the ethnographic museum as it seemed convenient and the cause (teaching disadvantaged children to cook) a good one. \nWe went to similar places in Vietnam where the food and service was simply amazing. Not the case here. The service was really average. The table cloth dirty. The dishes were brought 15min apart so I had mine when my friend had already finished here. And the food was really really average to tasteless to be absolutely honest. \nThe bill at the end was also incorrect.\nRead more\nWritten November 7, 2018",
