            "review_text": "Yulia G\n8 contributions\n1\nThey give change wrong! Food is ok\nJul 2018 • Family\nWe spend a wonderful time in museum and deceided to go to this nice restaurant. The food is good, but... They bring main food together with dessert with ice-cream, so ice-cream melted fast.\nI recomend you to order duck and rice. It's good. Desserts are so-so and I ate just a half of apple pie with melted ice-cream.\nIn the end they bring me bill earlier than I asked. Strange, but I almost finished so I just put 500k vnd there, while my bill was for 300k. And they bring me a charge of 8k. What??? So I said that I gave 500k and they gave me all correctly.\nRead more\nWritten July 10, 2018",
