            "review_text": "BecM_11\nMelbourne, Australia222 contributions\n1\nLovely cafe with great food\nApr 2017 • Family\nI was really impressed with this cafe. Not only do they provide work for disadvantaged youth, but the food was also really good! Museum cafes are notoriously bad, but this one had a great mix of Vietnamese and western food. The rice paper rolls were super fresh and I enjoyed my stir fried veggies.\nWritten April 5, 2017",
